<div id="urduTextPath">شہزادی فاطمہ زہرا (ص)/رو کے کہتی تھی فاطمہ زہرا</div>
<p>roke kehti thi fatima zehra<br />
sunlo rudaad ya habeebe quda<br />
gham se jalta hai ab jigar mera<br />
kya yahi ajr hai risaalat ka</p>

<p>lab pe ummat ka hai gila baba<br />
qoob pursa mujhe mila baba<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aap ke baad mujh pe zulm huwe<br />
mujh ko ummath ne hai diye sadme<br />
wo masayab uthaaye hai maine<br />
din pe padte to raat hojaate</p>

<p>accha hota jo mai guzar jaati<br />
aap se pehle kaash marjaati<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>be-sabab mere ghar pa aayi bala<br />
kya tha mera qusoor aye baba<br />
lakdiya leke aagaye aada<br />
mere darwaze ko jala daala</p>

<p>qatm joro jafa hui mujhpar<br />
zulm ki inteha hui mujhpar<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sun sako to suno meri rudaad<br />
dhaayi ummat ne mujh pe hai bedaad<br />
ro raha hai mera dile nashaad<br />
haal kis se karu mai ab faryaad</p>

<p>aag le le ke dushman aaye hai<br />
zulm mujh par layee&rsquo;n ne dhaaye hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>jalta darwaza jab gira mujh par<br />
khadi dewaar se thi mai lag kar<br />
rahem khaaya na mujh pe baa-niye shar<br />
paaou maloon ne rakha dar par</p>

<p>mujh ko darwaaze se daba dala<br />
aag se pairahan jala dala<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>zarb mere shikam pe aisi lagi<br />
jiski takleef bathn tak pohnchi<br />
pehlu toota mera jafa ye hui<br />
daro dewaar se mai dabti rahi</p>

<p>koi faryaad ko nahi aaya<br />
koi imdaad ko nahi aaya<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>shiddat-e zarb se hui eeza<br />
dard mere shikam me hone laga<br />
mai idhar tadpi wo udhar tadpa<br />
margaya bathn me mera baccha</p>

<p>kis se faryaad mai karu bolo<br />
ab mai kis tarah se jiyu bolo<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>mere mohsin ko haaye wawaila<br />
behayao'n ne qatl kar dala<br />
besabab mujh pe zulm hai dhaaya<br />
ab nahi koi poochne wala</p>

<p>mu ko ashko se dhoti rehti hu'n<br />
apne mohsin ko roti rahti hu'n<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>mera pursane haal koi nahi<br />
jeene ka ab sawaal koi nahi<br />
karne wala malaal koi nahi<br />
zaqm ka andmaal koi nahi</p>

<p>jism rah rah ke sard hota hai<br />
mere pehlu me dard hota hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>shiddat-e dard ka asar ye hua<br />
jism se toota jaan ka rishta<br />
jaan leva tha dard ka hamla<br />
hui bejaan fatema zehra</p>

<p>mujtaba karke bain rone lage<br />
peet kar sar hussain rone lage<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>